            "recorded_sha256": "7d4c77ac6901dce55e619a3ba9f6160c2751c1dff5b64c2185c83e01493c765b",
            "content": "---\nid: intake-contract\nstatus: pending\nsession-est: 0/2\nblockers: []\nprefetch: [.ai/design.md]\n---\n\n# State the intake contract's admission test\n\nBatch: evolution-batch-0009. Contract: `evolution/README.md`.\n\n## Goal\n\nIntake accepts anything a person types, so the pool holds work no session can start.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Require a goal, a scope and an acceptance line before a task is written.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- A task file missing any of the three is refused with the missing one named.\n\n## Session log\n",
            "content_sha256": "7d4c77ac6901dce55e619a3ba9f6160c2751c1dff5b64c2185c83e01493c765b"
          },
          {
