            "recorded_sha256": "a249a2e0c0f4e0f86cf3e980c16864486f2f7fef6f5423de2e557d91a90cbb1c",
            "content": "---\nid: intake-schema\nstatus: pending\nsession-est: 0/2\nblockers: []\nprefetch: [.ai/design.md]\n---\n\n# Version the taskfile frontmatter\n\nBatch: evolution-batch-0009. Contract: `evolution/README.md`.\n\n## Goal\n\nReaders guess the shape of a task file from the fields present.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Add a schema version to the frontmatter and state the reader's fallback.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- An unversioned file is read as version 1 rather than refused.\n\n## Session log\n",
            "content_sha256": "a249a2e0c0f4e0f86cf3e980c16864486f2f7fef6f5423de2e557d91a90cbb1c"
          },
          {
            "draft_id": "intake-skill",
            "state": "consumed",
            "experiment_id": "evolution-batch-0009-exp-02",
            "decided_at": "2026-09-01T11:01:00Z",
            "reason": null,
            "recorded_sha256": "2cc07e741b6527ee1cf0975c62ca3c50c47e3ff11c0c8a355cc7bbc50e23bd9f",
            "content": "---\nid: intake-skill\nstatus: pending\nsession-est: 0/2\nblockers: []\nprefetch: [.ai/design.md]\n---\n\n# Make the intake skill write what the contract requires\n\nBatch: evolution-batch-0009. Contract: `evolution/README.md`.\n\n## Goal\n\nThe skill and the contract describe different frontmatter.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Derive the skill's template from the schema document.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- A schema change that the skill would break fails the derivation test.\n\n## Session log\n",
            "content_sha256": "2cc07e741b6527ee1cf0975c62ca3c50c47e3ff11c0c8a355cc7bbc50e23bd9f"
          },
          {
            "draft_id": "intake-tests",
            "state": "consumed",
            "experiment_id": "evolution-batch-0009-exp-02",
            "decided_at": "2026-09-01T11:02:00Z",
