            "recorded_sha256": "8372ad76f0d58500f3d5d920445749c5f4ec1bd38ac52de4e6bca416d8d749c7",
            "content": "---\nid: intake-tests\nstatus: pending\nsession-est: 0/2\nblockers: []\nprefetch: [.ai/design.md]\n---\n\n# Cover intake refusals\n\nBatch: evolution-batch-0009. Contract: `evolution/README.md`.\n\n## Goal\n\nEvery intake test asserts the happy path.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Add refusal cases for each required field.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- Each refusal names the field it refused on.\n\n## Session log\n",
            "content_sha256": "8372ad76f0d58500f3d5d920445749c5f4ec1bd38ac52de4e6bca416d8d749c7"
          },
          {
            "draft_id": "loader-prefetch",
            "state": "waiting",
            "experiment_id": null,
            "decided_at": null,
            "reason": null,
            "recorded_sha256": null,
            "content": "---\nid: loader-prefetch\nstatus: pending\nsession-est: 0/2\nblockers: []\nprefetch: [.ai/design.md]\n---\n\n# Load prefetch documents through the routing index\n\nBatch: evolution-batch-0009. Contract: `evolution/README.md`.\n\n## Goal\n\nA prefetch path naming a document that moved is read as absent rather than as stale.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Resolve each declared path through `.ai/index.md` before reading it.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- A moved document is reported by name rather than skipped.\n\n## Session log\n",
            "content_sha256": "daa7ba0bacc4d62509be7b2e6ff62acd95a659167a4ba8d0bbc16f312567485f"
